BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Two Strangers (Carry a Cake Across New York)
DTSTART:20261020T233000Z
DTEND:20261021T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20261019T043033Z
UID:998041
DESCRIPTION:<p><em>Two Strangers (Carry a Cake Across New York) </em>is an
  uncommonly surprising musical about finding common ground. Tony Award&reg
 \; nominees Sam Tutty and Christiani Pitts star as Dougal and Robin\, an u
 nlikely pair who spend three life-changing days together in NYC. With a sc
 ore of instant classics and a story that&rsquo\;s equally hilarious and he
 artfelt\, <em>Two Strangers</em> is a completely original musical that &ld
 quo\;achieves something magical&rdquo\; (<em>Vulture</em>).<br /><br />&ld
 quo\;A must-see! The feel-good musical of the season.&rdquo\; &mdash\; <em
 >Cosmopolitan</em><br /><br />"A big\, original hit!" &mdash\; <em>Vogue</
 em><br /><br />&ldquo\;A Broadway hit! Laugh-out-loud funny.&rdquo\; &mdas
 h\; <em>Variety</em></p>
LOCATION:Longacre Theatre\, 220 West 48th Street\, New York NY 10036
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/Two-Strangers-carry-A-Cake-Across-New-York-
 Tickets
END:VEVENT
